    <string name="database_usage">Automatic archiving\nWhen enabled, new SMS is uploaded to the current profile’s archive service. While paused, messages stay on this phone and resume when enabled. Your existing inbox is not imported.\n\nFailed uploads\nMessages are marked complete only after the service confirms a successful write. Network or service failures are retried later. You can also choose “Retry unsent SMS”. Check the service URL and access token if uploads keep failing.\n\nSwitching profiles\nTap a card to activate it. Messages already assigned to a service keep that destination; switch back to the matching profile to resume them.\n\nBackground activity\nAllow background activity in system battery settings if uploads are delayed. Open the app again after force-stopping it.</string>
